WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
You are just a camp for deceivers.

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,440
How dare you swallow so many people?

3
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:04,480
Let me tell you if you can eat it?

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,960
Your conditions are just right for me

5
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,560
I am a reinforcement camp with thousands of people

6
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,520
Shortage of people

7
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:09,480
Also strengthen the camp

8
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,160
I was raped by the barbarians

9
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,480
I don’t know who saved you

10
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,480
How dare you ask for so much

11
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:15,200
I dare to swallow the rest

12
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:18,040
Are you looking for trouble?

13
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,230
So what if you are looking for trouble?

14
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:23,410
Forgot that you still owe me three hundred horses

15
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,490
As a result, you won’t pay it back if you say you won’t.

16
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:27,270
Fuck your grandma

17
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,060
Your mother lent me the spoils of war

18
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,180
I haven't told you yet

19
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,540
I just got married.

20
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:32,780
It’s not what you owe me

21
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:33,820
Her grandma's

22
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:35,140
Do you want to touch it?

23
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:48,550
If you touch it, you won’t be familiar with it.

24
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:50,420
Then don't ask for it

25
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:52,620
See if I don’t kill you today

26
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:54,180
Then don't do anything

27
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:56,140
I have endured it for a long time too
